  "ruleText": "Alc 102.01 “Board” means the board of licensing for alcohol and other drug use professionals established by RSA 330-C:3.\n\nSource. #8169, eff 9-21-04; ss by 9417, eff 3-14-09 (from Alc 102.03); ss by #14585, eff 6-1-26",
